{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07110","headline":"秋日登吴公台上寺远眺寺即陈将吴明彻战场 · 刘长卿","name":"秋日登吴公台上寺远眺寺即陈将吴明彻战场","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古台摇落後，秋日望乡心。\n野寺人来少，云峰水隔深。\n夕阳依旧垒，寒磬满空林。\n惆怅南朝事，长江独至今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry","citation":"萧涤非"}